Clear

!================ CIRCUIT DEFINITION ================
New Circuit.IEEE13Nodeckt 
~ basekv=115 phases=3 bus1=SourceBus Angle=30 

!================ TRANSFORMERS ================
New Transformer.Sub Phases=3 Windings=2 XHL=0.08
~ wdg=1 bus=SourceBus conn=delta kv=115 kva=5000 %r=1 
~ wdg=2 bus=650 conn=wye kv=4.16 kva=5000 %r=1  

